00:06:18.090 --> 00:06:20.550
Clothes do impact your health.

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:23.070
For example, women that wear high heels

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:26.100
for way too long periods
of time for many years

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:28.500
can actually develop some
deformities in their feet.

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:30.330
A bony deformity on the back of their heel

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:33.540
called a Haglund's deformity
also known as a pump bump

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:35.850
where it could actually
lead to Achilles tendonitis

00:06:35.850 --> 00:06:37.380
or other types of bursitis.

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:40.830
You can develop bunions,
a neuroma inside your foot

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:43.860
and all these are painful
conditions that usually,

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:46.740
if you continue wearing
heels, will need surgery.

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:49.080
And know that heels don't
just impact your feet,

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:50.820
they impact everything above as well

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:51.870
'cause it changes your gait,

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:53.820
it changes your balance, your stride,

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:56.340
so you get knee pain, hip
pain, low back pain, et cetera.

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:58.110
